  "html": "<p>Dew Valley Forest is, of course, where we all began running!  The Elm Forest Layout appears frequently after that.  It is one of the brightest and most beautiful layouts and it is fairly easy to see mobs ahead.  Despite the calm beauty it can contain some very nasty monsters.  The light filtered through the leaves has a definite tendency to give some things a greenish appearance.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>Elm Forest Layout Appearance\n</th><th>Elm Forest Layout Typical Map\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Layout_Forest.jpg\" title=\"Layout Forest.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"260\" src=\"/images/Layout_Forest.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Layout_Forest.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Map_Forest.jpg\" title=\"Map Forest.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"351\" src=\"/images/Map_Forest.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Map_Forest.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
